headers {
  accept: application/json
  content-type: application/json
}

vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:8000
  boardId: 1
  githubOAuthCode: paste-real-code-here
  githubOAuthState: paste-real-state-here
  ragRunId: 0
  vectorCollection: rag_evidence_chunks
}

docs {
  # warm-up API

  Docker Compose로 실행 중인 warm-up FastAPI 서버를 테스트하는 Bruno 컬렉션입니다.

  ## 실행 전 확인

  - app 컨테이너: `app`
  - API base URL: `http://localhost:8000`
  - Chroma: `http://localhost:8001`
  - Postgres: `localhost:5432`

  `Local` environment를 선택하고 요청을 실행하세요.
}
